  "Inventory notes: a Learn tab (articles, videos, James Clear / Atomic Habits material) and a 7-day e-mail course, strongly praised by early users and English-only; a web app and Chrome new-tab extension that pre-date the iPhone app, a Safari plugin by 2024; iPhone, iPad and Mac (the Mac build criticised as slow); Watch app and complications by Mar 2021 with unreliable phone sync; interactive home-screen widgets from iOS 14 (the widget fits 4 habits, the free tier allows 3); journal notes and calendar view (v3, Dec 2023); folders / habit groups (Aug 2025 — 'The new habit folder feature is — chef's kiss'); archive; Shortcuts ('one of the few that has shortcuts integration'); localised UI including Catalan, Arabic and Turkish",
